msgctxt "64"
msgid "I'll say this once: stay away from Miyu Shiraboshi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Shit... What the hell is this guy...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Mommy... I'm sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Thank goodness... Oh, I'm so happy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Did you miss Mommy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Everything's going to be okay now. Mommy will always be\r\n"
"there for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "...You promise?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"I promise! Mommy's not going to work here anymore!\r\n"
"We're all going back to Shizuoka!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Ahhahaha. Yay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Looks like everything's all right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Yeah... Grandpa and the others will be relieved to know\r\n"
"he's safe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "I'm sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"I really am sorry about what happened today. We wouldn't\r\n"
"be here right now if it wasn't for you, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Don't mention it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"That man in the suit... He was one of my regulars back\r\n"
"in Shizuoka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "He proposed to me after I got divorced..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"But I kept turning him down, telling him I had no intention\r\n"
"to remarry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"It was then he got the idea to get close to Subaru\r\n"
"so I wouldn't be able to reject him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"He would always hang around near my family's house\r\n"
"and try to talk to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "So that's who that was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "You don't have to worry anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Yeah, you're right. Thank you so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "...So, are you going back to Shizuoka?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"All I ever did was think about the future... And it made\r\n"
"me lose sight of what's right here in front of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "I'm truly glad to have met you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "...Hang in there, Miyu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> I'm always so happy when I'm "
"with you, Kiryu-san. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Heh... I'm glad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Before we say goodbye... I'd like to make one last memory..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"I want you to do whatever I tell you... Just for today, okay? "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

